              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Kille is a traditional trick-taking card game using 42-card Kille deck for 3-13 players. It belongs to the Cuckoo group and uses a dedicated Swedish Kille pack."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Kille is treated as a distinct traditional card game because the source identifies its own player count, pack, rank order, and trick-play objective rather than only listing it as a synonym."
